<p>The <a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ticKBt_fgdE">season finale</a> of Ian Dunt and Dorian Lynskey’s excellent <a href="https://www.podmasters.co.uk/origin-story">Origin Story podcast</a> is about the Luddites, and why the name doesn’t mean what you think it means.</p>
<p>It’s really about people reacting negatively to new technology that threatens their jobs, and therefore their livelihood. This might be extremely relevant to some modern technology topics, come to think of it.</p>
